//@version=6
// 3M ELITE v60 - THE SHORT LEG'S FIRST CLEAN MEASUREMENT. v57 BYTE-IDENTICAL except the DECLARED
// DEVIATION below (position sizing only -- entry/exit logic, filters and stop/target untouched).
//
// WHY THIS RUN EXISTS: v57's own header claimed "3M's structural stop sits inside the margin
// boundary, so [War Formation's] sizing fix is NOT needed here." That claim was never checked against
// v57's own trades -- only against v53's. get_trades on v57 (jobId 01M1NHJV2GH1XCTD8NDYR839R7, free,
// zero credits) DISPROVES it: grouping v57's 59 rows by entryBar into its 39 unique entries, 29 are net
// losers and 21 of those 29 (72%) never reach the 0.80% minimum stop distance (minRpct) before the
// position is force-closed -- the same cascade/margin-ceiling signature HARD LESSON 34 found in v53
// (74%), not the exemption v57's comment claimed. Two losing entries even show FOUR tranches at
// 0.194%/0.643%/1.081%/1.308% adverse (entryBar 20139) -- textbook margin-forced partial closes ahead
// of the real stop, not four separate signals.
//
// THE FIX, per HARD LESSON 42/43 (proven in War Formation E71: PF 0.45->0.97, win rate 6.98%->36.36%,
// from position sizing ALONE): reduce size so the required margin never crosses equity before the
// structural stop can fire. NOTHING ELSE CHANGES -- same 39-entry selection, same filters, same R
// floor, same stop/target geometry as v57. This isolates sizing as the only variable, exactly as E71
// did against E64a.
//
// DECLARED DEVIATION: position size 25% of equity via explicit Pine qty (eqFrac below), because the
// parity profile's default_qty_type=percent_of_equity/100 is what causes the margin call. NOT
// COMPARABLE to v37 (100%-equity long) or to any other 100%-equity 3M build. Label carried on every
// row this produces.
//
// PRE-REGISTERED OUTCOMES (LESSON 17), stated before running:
//   A) Cascade clears (losers now consistently >=0.80% adverse, cascadeRatio ~1) AND PF holds above
//      1.0 -> the source's bias-gated short mirror has REAL edge; the first honest positive 3M short.
//      Still cannot be "promoted" over v37 (different direction, not a competing champion), but
//      becomes the first trustworthy 3M short number on record.
//   B) Cascade clears AND PF falls below 1.0 (or reverses sign) -> v57's 1.222673 was substantially
//      the margin-truncation artifact HARD LESSON 34 warned of ("a correctly-stopped short would very
//      likely score worse, not better"). The short leg stays paused; the source's own bias rule alone
//      does not rescue it once measured cleanly.
//   Either outcome answers, with real evidence rather than a header assertion, whether 3M's only
//   profitable short is real.
//
// AUDIT, one line per leg (short only, per LESSON 6 as scoped by HARD LESSON 31 -- this is a source
// mirror, not an invented geometry):
//   R >= 0.8% (LESSON 3) - unchanged from v57, by EXCLUSION via rBig, never clamped.
//   Stop beyond STRUCTURE (LESSON 5) - unchanged, slPx = szTop (supply zone high).
//   BINDING (E17) - N/A this run: no selection term added or removed, so the entry set cannot change.
//   REDUNDANCY (E14) - N/A, no new term.
//   LATCH IN SEQUENCE (LESSON 8) - unchanged from v57.
//   CASCADE (HARD LESSONS 35/42) - THIS IS THE THING BEING TESTED. VERIFY WITH get_trades AFTER
//      RUNNING: confirm losers now exit at >=0.80% adverse and cascadeRatio drops toward 1.
//   SL and TP FIXED AT ENTRY. No trailing, no averaging down, no martingale.
strategy("3M ELITE v60 short declared deviation 25pct", overlay=true,
     pyramiding=1, process_orders_on_close=true,
     commission_type=strategy.commission.percent, commission_value=0.05,
     initial_capital=10000,
     default_qty_type=strategy.percent_of_equity, default_qty_value=100,
     margin_long=100, margin_short=100)

rTarget  = input.float(2.0, "Target, x R -- held at v37/v53/v57")
maxBars  = input.int(96,    "Max bars in trade -- held")
maxAge   = input.int(6,     "Zone freshness cap, 4H candles -- held")
minRpct  = input.float(0.80,"Min stop distance as % of price (LESSON 3)")
maFast   = input.int(20,    "THE SOURCE'S STACK: fast MA")
maMid    = input.int(50,    "THE SOURCE'S STACK: middle MA")
maSlow   = input.int(200,   "THE SOURCE'S STACK: slow MA -- his higher-timeframe read")
eqFrac   = input.float(0.25,"DECLARED DEVIATION: fraction of equity per position -- HARD LESSON 42")

sma20  = ta.sma(close, maFast)
sma50  = ta.sma(close, maMid)
sma200 = ta.sma(close, maSlow)
stackBear = not na(sma200) and sma20 < sma50 and sma50 < sma200

MS4H = 14400000
b4h  = math.floor(time / MS4H)
new4h = b4h != b4h[1]

var float o4 = na
var float h4 = na
var float l4 = na

var float pO  = na
var float pH  = na
var float pL  = na
var float pC  = na
var float ppO = na
var float ppC = na

if new4h and not na(o4)
    ppO := pO
    ppC := pC
    pO  := o4
    pH  := h4
    pL  := l4
    pC  := close[1]

if new4h
    o4 := open
    h4 := high
    l4 := low
else
    h4 := na(h4) ? high : math.max(h4, high)
    l4 := na(l4) ? low  : math.min(l4, low)

bearEngulf = not na(ppO) and not na(ppC) and not na(pO) and not na(pC) and ppC > ppO and pC < pO and pC < ppO

var float szTop   = na
var float szBot   = na
var bool  szLive  = false
var int   szTouch = 0
var int   szAge   = 0
var bool  szTraded = false

if new4h
    if szLive and not na(pC) and pC >= szBot
        szTouch := szTouch + 1
        if szTouch >= 2
            szLive := false
    if szLive
        szAge := szAge + 1
    if bearEngulf
        szTop   := pH
        szBot   := pO
        szLive  := true
        szTouch := 0
        szAge   := 0
        szTraded := false

minR     = close * minRpct / 100
rBig     = not na(szTop) and (szTop - close) >= minR

shortCond = rBig and szLive and not szTraded and szAge >= 1 and szTouch < 2 and high >= szBot and close < szTop and szAge <= maxAge and stackBear

flat = strategy.position_size == 0

var float slPx   = na
var float tpPx   = na
var int   barsIn = 0

qtyUse = strategy.equity * eqFrac / close

if flat and shortCond and not na(szTop) and close < szTop
    r = szTop - close
    if r > 0
        strategy.entry("S", strategy.short, qty = qtyUse)
        szTraded := true
        slPx   := szTop
        tpPx   := close - r * rTarget
        barsIn := 0

if strategy.position_size < 0
    strategy.exit("SX", from_entry="S", stop=slPx, limit=tpPx)
    barsIn := barsIn + 1

if barsIn >= maxBars and strategy.position_size != 0
    strategy.close_all()
    barsIn := 0

plot(szLive ? 1 : 0,     title="SupplyZoneLive")
plot(stackBear ? 1 : 0,  title="StackBear")
